Understand the code
- X contains the customer features.
- StandardScaler() standardizes the features.
- KMeans(n_clusters=2) requests two clusters.
- fit_predict() fits the clustering model and returns a cluster assignment for each point.
- plt.scatter() visualizes the data, with colors representing the assigned clusters.
Cluster IDs such as 0 and 1 are arbitrary labels. Cluster 0 is not inherently better than cluster 1.
